P GROUP BERHAD at the EGM on 29 September.","notable_en":["Completed the acquisition of a 51% equity interest in VSure Tech for RM5.00 million, partly satisfied with new shares.","Proposed bonus issue of free warrants on the basis of 1 warrant for every 2 existing shares.","EGM approved the appointment of new external auditors and the change of company name to TFP GROUP BERHAD."],"risks_en":["The acquisition consideration was partly satisfied via the issuance of 200,000,000 new shares, which may dilute existing shareholders.","Triton Capital Fund VCC filed multiple substantial shareholder interest change announcements between September and October."],"earnings_en":""}